45
00:02:43,509 --> 00:02:44,300
AUDIENCE: It was 6.

46
00:02:44,300 --> 00:02:46,220
PROFESSOR: 6?

47
00:02:46,220 --> 00:02:46,970
AUDIENCE: Yes, 6.

48
